EPICS archiver appliance: third-party licenses and notices
=========================================================

The appliance's own license is in ../LICENSE. This inventory covers the
libraries in WEB-INF/lib of the mgmt, engine, etl and retrieval WARs, the
vendored browser assets, and generated documentation assets. Build tools,
test-only dependencies and separately installed Tomcat are outside this
inventory. Maven dependency versions and packaging are defined in ../pom.xml.

License filenames below are relative to this directory. Original copyright,
LICENSE and NOTICE entries inside dependency JARs and browser files remain
part of their distributions; this inventory does not replace those entries.
Dependency upgrades require updating the corresponding inventory and notices.

